# ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a team of senior full-stack engineers, AI/ML researchers, geospatial engineers, logistics industry experts, autonomous agent developers, and enterprise SaaS designers.

Your task is to **DESIGN, DEVELOP, INTEGRATE, AND RUN** a complete, professional, hackathon-ready web application named:

# NETRA — AI-Powered Freight Corridor Intelligence & Decision-Support Platform

**Tagline:** Predict. Detect. Analyze. Optimize. Recommend.

NETRA is designed for Indian logistics companies, freight operators, fleet managers, and transportation control towers.

The platform must enable logistics companies to monitor freight corridors, manage vehicles and shipments, predict disruptions, optimize routes, simulate emergencies, and receive intelligent operational recommendations.

This project is being developed for a national-level hackathon.

The application must be technically convincing, visually professional, and functional during a live demonstration.

